[00:13.32]1. We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:26.64]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:39.96]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:53.28]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[01:01.82]2. We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[01:10.36]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[01:18.91]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[01:27.45]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[01:36.00]3. We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[02:00.97]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[02:25.94]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[02:50.91]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.